        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Comme il a horreur de l’eau, on le trouve surtout dans les régions arides. Avec si peu de verdure alentour, on le repère tout de suite.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It does not deal well with water, so it lives in dry locales. Since its surroundings tend to lack greenery, it stands out noticeably.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "水が　苦手で　乾いた　場所に 棲んでいる。　周りに　緑が 少ないので　よく　目立つ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "からだの　よけいな　すいぶんを　めから そとに　だす。　その　せいぶんは にんげんの　あせに　にている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il se débarrasse des liquides superflus par ses yeux. La composition chimique de ces liquides ressemble à celle de la sueur humaine.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "From its eyes, it can expel excess moisture from its body. This liquid is similar in composition to human sweat.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "身体の　余計な　水分を　目から 外に　出す。　その　成分は 人間の　汗に　似ている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "ひとみから　すいぶんを　ほうしゅつ。 ないているように　みえるので　てきを ゆだんさせる　こうかも　あるらしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il évacue tout surplus d’eau par les yeux. Cela ressemble à une crise de larmes et a parfois pour effet d’attendrir ses ennemis.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It discharges moisture from its eyes, making it look like it’s crying—apparently an effective way of getting enemies to let down their guard.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "瞳から　水分を　放出。 泣いているように　見えるので　敵を 油断させる　効果も　あるらしい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "あまり　からだが　しめりすぎると しんでしまうので　あせの　ように めから　すいぶんを　だしている。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Absorber trop d’humidité peut mettre sa vie en danger, c’est pourquoi il « sue » tout excès de liquide par les yeux.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "If its body gets too damp, it will die. So, in a process reminiscent of sweating, its eyes expel moisture.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "あまり　身体が　湿りすぎると 死んでしまうので　汗の　ように 目から　水分を　出している。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/30/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "あせと　なみだを　めから　ながす。 あせは　ちょっぴり　しょっぱくて なみだは　ほんのり　にがい　あじだ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il évacue sa sueur et ses larmes par les yeux. Sa sueur a un goût légèrement salé, tandis que ses larmes ont un soupçon d’amertume.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It expels both sweat and tears from its eyes. The sweat is a little salty, while the tears have a slight bitterness.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "汗と　涙を　目から　流す。 汗は　ちょっぴり　しょっぱくて 涙は　ほんのり　苦い　味だ。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sword",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/33/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "かんそうした　いわばに　くらす。 みどりの　たまは　かわくほど ツヤツヤと　にぶく　かがやく。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
